{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Templar - Supporter Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/715011c237afa53835a5b6e17e4c906b.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The strength of the wild rises in defiance of time. With the Primal Templar pack, your journey deepens into the heart of the Ancient Era, where survival demanded reverence, cunning, and power drawn from claw, bone, and earth itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <i>This pack contains exclusive <strong>cosmetic-only items</strong> and includes all items from the Traveler packs, along with unique <strong>cosmetic-only items</strong> that do not affect gameplay or power.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Pack also contains the following Supporter Packs:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/e25074af7b280c01c9491a2db9ec281b.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Traveler Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following items are unique to the Primal Templar - Supporter Pack:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Saurian Hide Cloak</strong> <i>(Backslot Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This cloak of hardened leather, adorned with cerulean feathers and bone fragments, whispers of the ancient hunts. Draped across your shoulders, it blends ferocity with reverence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/39e094ee13fe58affa78ae636d43d4e4.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fossilized Portal</strong> <i>(Portal Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step through the fossilized remains of an adolescent dragon, its bones a relic of Eterra\u2019s forgotten past. Reclaimed by time, this ancient threshold hums with lingering primal energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/e626e1f72c2e3c1166fd35df8ec89038.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Slicer</strong> <i>(1H Sword Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiseled from jagged stone and bound in sinew and teeth, this blade is a relic of a forgotten era where steel was unknown and survival was sacred. Each swing is a tribute to raw instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/f49c18e29f5b8bc33504f12248464a64.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wild Hunter\u2019s Leather</strong> <i>(Armor Set Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wearing the skull of a long-dead predator and the hide of the earth\u2019s fiercest beasts, this armor tells the story of a hunter who never became prey. Blue feathers and a wyrmling add trophies of wisdom and might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/90fcf7d7fe15064d5f236152070eb71b.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Soul Evade</strong> <i>(Evade Effect Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each quick step, a glowing, spectral dragon-tail fans out behind you\u2014an echo of primal essence that surges with your momentum, as though ancient spirits lend you speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/e3ce801c51907b57cbc1493748b62e82.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earth Shaker Footprints</strong> <i>(Footprint Effect Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive saurian footprints pound the ground in your wake, each one radiating golden tremors. You do not walk\u2014you leave a legend behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/b85f1d525c0d058a148d60b46dea0dd9.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>150 Epoch Points (EP)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital currency to further customize your journey. Use these points to purchase additional cosmetics from the in-game cosmetic shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/68ba7ebfc2b666d0895ce7a936de19a5.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Templar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark your presence in the community with the crest of the Primal Templar\u2014proof that your strength is rooted in the oldest echoes of Eterra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/1214b41eb28537d9ae785c357fe2b041.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1600 height=291 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865730?t=1755012591","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865730?t=1755012591","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/8ddf824385cc87dea2be3a166e3ebcb6b0604c6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755012591","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/8ddf824385cc87dea2be3a166e3ebcb6b0604c6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755012591","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Templar - Supporter Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/715011c237afa53835a5b6e17e4c906b.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The strength of the wild rises in defiance of time. With the Primal Templar pack, your journey deepens into the heart of the Ancient Era, where survival demanded reverence, cunning, and power drawn from claw, bone, and earth itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <i>This pack contains exclusive <strong>cosmetic-only items</strong> and includes all items from the Traveler packs, along with unique <strong>cosmetic-only items</strong> that do not affect gameplay or power.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Pack also contains the following Supporter Packs:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/e25074af7b280c01c9491a2db9ec281b.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Traveler Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following items are unique to the Primal Templar - Supporter Pack:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Saurian Hide Cloak</strong> <i>(Backslot Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This cloak of hardened leather, adorned with cerulean feathers and bone fragments, whispers of the ancient hunts. Draped across your shoulders, it blends ferocity with reverence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865730/extras/39e094ee13fe58affa78ae636d43d4e4.avif?t=1755012591\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fossilized Portal</strong> <i>(Portal Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step through the fossilized remains of an adolescent dragon, its bones a relic of Eterra\u2019s forgotten past. Reclaimed by time, this ancient threshold hums with lingering primal energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p 